{"layout": [], "most_frequent_angle": 0, "ocr": [{"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1025.0, 271.0], [1533.0, 274.0], [1533.0, 321.0], [1025.0, 317.0]], "score": 0.9849202036857605, "text": "SIXIEME RESOLUTION"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[326.0, 377.0], [2232.0, 384.0], [2232.0, 435.0], [325.0, 428.0]], "score": 0.979745090007782, "text": "L'assemblée générale donne tous pouvoirs au porteur de copies ou d’extraits du présent"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[327.0, 435.0], [1397.0, 435.0], [1397.0, 481.0], [327.0, 481.0]], "score": 0.9891090989112854, "text": "procès-verbal pour remplir toutes formalités de droit."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[326.0, 536.0], [1130.0, 540.0], [1130.0, 586.0], [325.0, 582.0]], "score": 0.9903832674026489, "text": "Cette résolution, mise aux voix, est :"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[321.0, 584.0], [562.0, 588.0], [561.0, 643.0], [320.0, 639.0]], "score": 0.9986830353736877, "text": "adoptée"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[322.0, 639.0], [534.0, 639.0], [534.0, 692.0], [322.0, 692.0]], "score": 0.9982975721359253, "text": "rejetée"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[322.0, 687.0], [921.0, 687.0], [921.0, 750.0], [322.0, 750.0]], "score": 0.9922336935997009, "text": "ayant voté pour"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[563.0, 752.0], [956.0, 752.0], [956.0, 798.0], [563.0, 798.0]], "score": 0.999002993106842, "text": "ayant voté contre"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[560.0, 798.0], [1486.0, 804.0], [1486.0, 855.0], [560.0, 850.0]], "score": 0.9928621649742126, "text": "s'étant abstenues de prendre part au vote"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[320.0, 959.0], [2225.0, 966.0], [2225.0, 1018.0], [320.0, 1011.0]], "score": 0.9994685053825378, "text": "L'ordre du jour étant épuisé et personne ne demandant plus la parole, le président déclare la"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[322.0, 1011.0], [612.0, 1015.0], [611.0, 1062.0], [322.0, 1059.0]], "score": 0.9997